\newlabel{table_loss_magnitude}{{XII}{24}{Loss Component Magnitude Comparison: magnitude disparity analysis to validate weighting configuration. Shows raw values, applied weights, and weighted contributions for each component to total generator loss.\relax }{table.caption.23}{}}
